# Xarcabard, Land of Truths (Bastok 5-2): the arms the main flow does not take. Karst at status 2: his default 601; the
# Throne Room zone-in at status 2 with PostBattle 1 and at 3 with PostBattle 0: nothing; _4l1 at status 1: the
# battlefield refuses (NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY) and the zone's default messageSpecial -1 (32767). Four wins by a GM
# (bfwin): at status 2 (inside the event) and with battlefieldWin 0: the title only; with Zilart's The New Frontier
# current (a GM's addMission: the engine's warning over the 65535 Zilart row) and then completed: not added, PostBattle
# 1, the set-down, the zone-in 7 and its finishes (the mission's and Zone.lua's) as in the main flow.
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/Pavvke/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Karst/onTrigger Metalworks/_6ld/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/602 Metalworks/onEventFinish/603 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 ThroneRoom/_4l1/onTrigger ThroneRoom/_4l2/onTrigger ThroneRoom/onZoneIn/1 ThroneRoom/onEventUpdate/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32001 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32002 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32003 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32004 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/6 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/7
